    "body": "## 🚀 Features\n\n- chore(deps): update com.mikepenz:version-catalog to 0.22.0\n   - PR: #1483\n\n## 🐛 Fixes\n\n- Log stack trace when loading resource fails\n   - PR: #1466\n\n## 💬 Other\n\n- chore(deps): update mike penz internal projects\n   - PR: #1465\n- fix(deps): update dependency com.mikepenz:version-catalog to v0.21.0\n   - PR: #1468\n- chore(deps): update mikepenz/release-changelog-builder-action digest to aa01373\n   - PR: #1470\n- chore(deps): update github actions updates\n   - PR: #1471\n- chore(deps): update actions/setup-java action to v6\n   - PR: #1479\n- fix(deps): update dependency org.apache.maven:maven-model-builder to v3.10.0\n   - PR: #1478\n- fix(deps): update dependency me.mmckenna.dejavu:dejavu to v0.5.0\n   - PR: #1477\n- chore(deps): update plugin org.gradle.plugin-compatibility to v1.1.0\n   - PR: #1476\n- fix(deps): update dependency androidx.core:core-ktx to v1.19.1\n   - PR: #1472\n- fix(deps): update navigation to v2.10.2\n   - PR: #1473\n- chore(deps): update plugin com.gradle.plugin-publish to v2.2.1\n   - PR: #1475\n- chore(deps): update gradle to v9.8.0\n   - PR: #1474\n- fix(core): remove println in favor of logger\n   - PR: #1480\n- chore(deps): update gradle to v9.8.1\n   - PR: #1481\n- chore(core): add SDK ownership verification file\n   - PR: #1482\n\n\n## Contributors:\n- @renovate-mike[bot], @cketti, @mikepenz",
